					<source><pc id="c1" type="ui" subType="swi18n:par" swi18n:slot="children">In this skill you get familiar with the <pc id="c2" type="ui" subType="swi18n:term" swi18n:slot="children">definition of the power</pc>. It should become intuitive to rewrite <ph id="c3" type="ui" subType="swi18n:inline-math"/> to <ph id="c4" type="ui" subType="swi18n:inline-math"/>, and equivalently it should be second nature to realize <ph id="c5" type="ui" subType="swi18n:inline-math"/> simply means <ph id="c6" type="ui" subType="swi18n:inline-math"/>.</pc></source>
					<target swi18n:sourceContentFingerprint="645643689c88781b" swi18n:sourceStructureFingerprint="e14b76ae2bc35c7d"><pc id="c1" type="ui" subType="swi18n:par" swi18n:slot="children">In dieser Kompetenz wirst du mit der <pc id="c2" type="ui" subType="swi18n:term" swi18n:slot="children">Definition der Potenz</pc> vertraut. Es sollte intuitiv werden, <ph id="c3" type="ui" subType="swi18n:inline-math"/> in <ph id="c4" type="ui" subType="swi18n:inline-math"/> umzuschreiben, und ebenso sollte es zur Gewohnheit werden, zu erkennen, dass <ph id="c5" type="ui" subType="swi18n:inline-math"/> einfach <ph id="c6" type="ui" subType="swi18n:inline-math"/> bedeutet.</pc></target>
